  "ownership_argument": [
    "The replay caller owns the deserialized BodyTree; CheckedTree owns that same tree with no Drop implementation and has no Current borrow.",
    "The new private helper validates the raw tree against its borrowed immutable Current, runs the same current_state guard, converts to fully owned Expr values, and moves the validated tree into expected.",
    "The deleted second validation had identical input value and Current; no mutation, query, span/symbol interning or callback intervened. Check and Order predicates remain executed once.",
    "PreparedBody keeps its immutable Current borrow until the unchanged caller detaches owned body values, constructs the existing exclusive ReadyHit and commits under all existing replay-plan/trace/recapture/poststate checks.",
    "Old prepare(&CheckedTree,&Current) and every cold caller stay byte-identical, preserving required revalidation of foreign/stale CheckedTree values."
  ],
